2. Comma , ka Use

print() function comma ke sath different data types ko automatically handle kar leta hai.

print("Active connections:", 15)

Output:

Active connections: 15
Easy Explanation:
+ operator sirf same type (string + string) ko jor sakta hai.
Integer ko pehle str() se string banayein, ya print() mein comma , use karein.
